# Terraform — credentials and state (never commit these)
**/terraform/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/terraform/.terraform/
**/terraform/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Ansible — group_vars encrypted with SOPS (safe to commit once encrypted).
# Do NOT commit a plaintext all.yml. Encrypt first: sops --encrypt --in-place group_vars/all.yml
# Plaintext backups or unencrypted copies:
**/ansible/group_vars/all.yml.plain

# OS
.DS_Store
